---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | GOWELLDE" description="How GOWELLDE Welding Technology collects, uses and protects information submitted through this website." path="/privacy-policy/"
  alternates={false}>
  <section class="py-14 bg-brand-light">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-brand-dark mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how GOWELLDE Welding Technology ("we", "us") handles information you submit through this
          website, mainly via our inquiry form and email links.
        </p>
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit an inquiry, we receive the details you provide: your name, email address, country, the models and quantities you are interested in, and your message.</p>
        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To reply to your inquiry and prepare quotations</li>
          <li>To send you catalog or technical information you requested</li>
          <li>To keep a record of business communication</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell, rent or share your personal information with third parties except where required to process shipping or payments for your order.</p>
        <h2>Cookies & analytics</h2>
        <p>We may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand aggregate site usage. You can block cookies in your browser settings without losing site functionality.</p>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You may request a copy or deletion of the personal data we hold about you at any time by emailing us.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
